# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust / backend
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Keep Cargo.lock for applications. Keep .sqlx/ because SQLx offline metadata
# is part of the reproducible build and should be reviewed/versioned.

